<title>USA: Pick Communications Corp. plans buy back.</title>
<headline>Pick Communications Corp. plans buy back.</headline>
<dateline>WAYNE, N.J. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pick Communications Corp said it plans to buy back up to 10 million shares.</p>
<p>The company's board said it authorized the repurchase program because it believes that the company's stock is trading &quot;at a significant discount to its value.&quot;</p>
<p>In morning trading on Thursday, Pick's stock was up about two cents to $0.27 per share.</p>
</text>
